; Go back into fullscreen mode on resume; Demul requires it twice
WinActivate, gpu
Send !{Enter}
Send !{Enter}

Emulator.LoadStateAutoHotkeyScript:
; PLEASE READ: Demul does not have a load state key bound by default!
; You must go to Config > Controls in Demul and bind the Load State
; option to the F9 key in order for this to work!
Send {F9 down}
Sleep 200
Send {F9 up}

